+    // HeadsetClientStateMachine.enableScoAudio / routeHfpAudio, AtcUtils.isAtcAOSPSupport). On when the device sets
+    // ro.librehu.hfp_atc_keys=bluetooth (device.mk); LibreHU-service then leaves these keys to this app.
